This product includes software developed as part of NeuralNote
(https://github.com/DamRsn/NeuralNote), Copyright 2024 Damien Ronssin,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. NeuralNote was written by
Damien Ronssin and Tibor Vass, with its user interface designed by
Perrine Morel.

Quarry is a modified fork of NeuralNote. Changes made to the original
work include, but are not limited to:

  - An audio input picker that, in the standalone app, records from a
    chosen audio device, and on Windows from the computer's own playback
    output via WASAPI loopback, instead of only from the audio the host
    sends the plugin.
  - Distinct plugin identity (product name, manufacturer and plugin codes,
    bundle id) so it can be installed alongside the original NeuralNote.
  - User interface changes to the recording controls.
  - Build and packaging changes.

See CHANGELOG.md for the per-release detail.

